<title>PHILIPPINES: Sinophil to be converted into holding firm.</title>
<headline>Sinophil to be converted into holding firm.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil exploration firm Sinophil Corp said on Tuesday its board of directors had approved a change in the primary purpose of the company to a holding or investment firm.</p>
<p>In a disclosure to the Philippine Stock Exchange, Sinophil said the proposed change will be submitted to shareholders for approval at a special meeting on March 10.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
